Tutor: Mia, this is my classmate, Alex.
#objective: Greet Alex — say "Nice to meet you"
#chunks: This is my friend, Mia.,Nice to meet you.,Nice to meet you too.
#user_input
Tutor: Hi, Alex. Nice to meet you.
#objective: Return the greeting
#chunks: Nice to meet you too.,Nice to meet you.
#user_input
Tutor: Alex is my classmate.
#objective: Acknowledge the introduction
#chunks: This is my friend, Mia.,Nice to meet you.
#user_input
Tutor: Is this your first class, Alex?
#objective: Answer — it's your first class
#chunks: Nice to meet you.,Nice to meet you too.
#user_input
Tutor: Lin, are you new too?
#objective: Confirm you're new
#chunks: This is my friend, Mia.,Nice to meet you too.
#user_input
Tutor: That's nice. Welcome.
#objective: Thank Mia for the welcome
#chunks: Nice to meet you.,Nice to meet you too.,This is my friend, Mia.
#user_input
Tutor: Wonderful! You can now introduce friends and respond to first meetings naturally.
-> END
